    {
      "id": 17242,
      "nameEs": "Doctor Who: Evacuation Earth",
      "originalName": "Doctor Who: Evacuation Earth",
      "year": 2010,
      "igdbId": 47842,
      "popularity": 2,
      "iconic": false,
      "fields": [
        {
          "field": "name_es",
          "value": "Doctor Who: Evacuation Earth",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Doctor Who: Evacuation Earth",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "This is your chance to be the Doctor and guide him and Amy Pond on a thrilling new adventure.\nArriving on Earth only hours before a Solar Storm is due to wipe out all life on the planet, the Doctor and his companion discover the last group of humans preparing to evacuate. No sooner have they arrived then the TARDIS disappears and they embark on a mission to recover it, encountering Silurians and Daleks along the way.\n\nStaring the voices of Matt Smith and Karen Gillan, this brand new official Doctor Who storyline includes over 100 puzzles, plus over 60 exciting locations to explore.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Esta es tu oportunidad de ser el Doctor y guiarlo a él y a Amy Pond en una emocionante nueva aventura. Al llegar a la Tierra solo unas horas antes de que una tormenta solar acabe con toda la vida del planeta, el Doctor y su compañera descubren al último grupo de humanos que se prepara para evacuar. Apenas llegan, el TARDIS desaparece y se embarcan en una misión para recuperarlo, enfrentándose a silurianos y Daleks por el camino. Con las voces de Matt Smith y Karen Gillan, esta nueva historia oficial de Doctor Who incluye más de 100 puzzles y más de 60 lugares emocionantes por explorar.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2010",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
