        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Doctor Who: Return to Earth",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The Doctor and Amy arrive on the deserted starship the Lucy Gray, which was the first ship to return to earth after the solar storms of the 26th century. However, on the ship are the Daleks and Cybermen, who are after the dangerous Time Axis. The Doctor and Amy must prevent them from obtaining it.\n\nThe game is written by Doctor Who writer Oli Smith and features Matt Smith and Karen Gillan providing voices for their characters.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "El Doctor y Amy llegan a la nave espacial abandonada Lucy Gray, la primera en regresar a la Tierra tras las tormentas solares del siglo XXVI. Sin embargo, a bordo están los Daleks y los Cybermen, que van tras el peligroso Eje Temporal. El Doctor y Amy deben impedir que lo consigan.\n\nEl juego está escrito por el guionista de Doctor Who Oli Smith y cuenta con Matt Smith y Karen Gillan poniendo voz a sus personajes.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
